# -------------------------------------------------------------- materials ---
# wall, floor, ceiling
block hull     hull
block habhull  hull2 floor ceil
block drum     drum
block ice      ice
block strip    strip hull2 hull2
block spine    grate
block girder   girder
block fin      fin
block scorch   scorch
