# ----------------------------------------------------------------- damage ---
# Last, so every hole goes through whatever was built where it landed. Every
# one of them is above D6's ceiling or outside the hull below it: the six
# lower decks were a long way from the fighting.
#
# Hydroponics, blown open from outside: the war stopped being about who ran
# the ship when someone decided the other side could starve. The hole climbs
# through the staff flats into the residences.
blast 106 135 76 3.5 seed=1 scorch=scorch debris=10
blast 106 135 84 3.5 seed=21 scorch=scorch debris=10
# The promenade's glass, gone on the north side, and what was behind it froze.
