# The two bulkheads that close the six lower decks off, one under D1 and one
# over D6: a plate across the well with a one-voxel way through it, and a slide
# door lying flat in that hole. A facing with a Y in it turns the leaf out of
# the floor plane, and it slides along its own up - which is now sideways,
# under the plate beside it. See AGENTS.md.
fill hatch 79 115 79 81 115 81
clear 80 115 80 80 115 80
